            "trust": "verified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
            "body": "You answer analysts' questions about Fjord Capital's published reports. Use only the report excerpts in the evidence, give figures with their units, and say when the report does not cover a question."
          }
        ],
        "excluded": []
      },
      {
        "producer": {
